{"repositoryId":1210176694,"availability":"available","full":"federicodecillia/wegrocery","name":"wegrocery","description":"WeGrocery — open-source white-label platform for food co-ops and buying groups: weekly order cycles, shared ledger, supplier management. One codebase, brand-per-deploy. In production for a Rome co-op.","category":"Developer tools","language":"TypeScript","stars":3,"forks":0,"created":"2026-04-14T06:49:58Z","updated":"2026-10-12T07:05:13Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://porta-moneta.vercel.app","topics":["claude-code","cooperative","drizzle-orm","food-coop","gas","group-buying","neon","nextjs","open-source","postgres","react","react-server-components","self-hosted","typescript","vercel","white-label"],"demo":"https://wegrocery-demo.vercel.app/","color":"#25392f","ink":"#d1e5c5","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-12T11:46:07.205Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-12T11:46:07.205Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-12T11:46:07.205Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-12T11:46:07.205Z","stars":3,"forks":0}],"technologies":["React","Next.js"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["WeGrocery runs the weekly purchasing cycle of a buying group: members order within a time-boxed window, the system tracks each member's prepaid balance like a ledger, and an admin closes the cycle, charges everyone, splits shipping, and emails the order to the supplier.","It is not a toy demo: it has been in production since 2025 for Porta Moneta, a Milan residents' association running a food-buying group (GAS, Gruppo di Acquisto Solidale) that uses it every week — real money math, real concurrency control, real members. Porta Moneta is the first white-label deployment of this codebase.","It is also a complete reference implementation of a modern Next.js app: App Router, React Server Components, Server Actions, Better Auth, Drizzle ORM on serverless Postgres, deployed on Vercel."],"features":["Co-ops, GAS groups, buying clubs that need an ordering + balance tool:","Deve